WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.777
Creating a single fee record

00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:09.146
Open Finance, then Collect Payments.

00:00:14.192 --> 00:00:16.766
Press Generate Single Fee Record.

00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:24.224
Select the class, then search for the student and pick them from the list.

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:34.749
Choose the fee category. The amount fills in from the fee structure.

00:00:36.073 --> 00:00:45.616
If the student has already paid, enter the amount paid. Then press Create. The window closes and the new record appears in the table.

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:53.416
Fee record created
